    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">Table&nbsp;2.02</span></strong><span style=\"color: windowtext;\"> Antibodies to detect myoepithelial cells</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "adapted from WHO Classification of Tumours Editorial Board. Breast tumours. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2019. (WHO classification of tumours series, 5th ed.; vol. 2). https://publications.iarc.who.int/581.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 456.7pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"609\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Myoepithelial marker</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Subcellular localization</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Comments</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">High-molecular-weight (basal) cytokeratins (CK5, CK5/6, CK14, CK17)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Often stain basal-like epithelial cells (in epithelial hyperplasia of usual type and some cases of high-grade in&nbsp;situ and invasive carcinomas), as well as occasional luminal cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SMA</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stains stromal myofibroblasts</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">MSA</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Stains stromal myofibroblasts</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Calponin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stains stromal myofibroblasts</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Caldesmon</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">No reactivity with stromal myofibroblasts</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">SMMHC</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stains stromal myofibroblasts</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 7; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">p63</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Nuclear</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Often stains epithelial cells of in&nbsp;situ and invasive carcinomas that show metaplastic spindle cell and squamous cell differentiation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 8; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">p40</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Nuclear</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Often stains epithelial cells of in&nbsp;situ and invasive carcinomas that show metaplastic spindle cell and squamous cell differentiation</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 9; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">p75-NGFR (p75)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic and membranous</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">May decorate endothelial cells, vascular adventitia, stromal cells, and benign and malignant epithelial cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 10; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">CD10</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">May weakly stain stromal myofibroblasts</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 11; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">S100</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic and nuclear</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">May stain normal, hyperplastic, and neoplastic epithelial cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 12; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">GFAP</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Myoepithelial marker (low sensitivity); positive in pleomorphic adenoma and adenomyoepithelioma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 13; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Maspin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic and nuclear</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">May stain normal, hyperplastic, and neoplastic epithelial cells</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 14; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">P-cadherin</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic and membranous</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stains some high-grade carcinomas</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 15; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">D2-40</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Cytoplasmic</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Stains endothelial cells and lymphatic channels</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 16; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 129.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"173\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">WT1</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 84.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cytoplasmic</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 242.85pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"324\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Stains endothelial cells</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
